osx-gpu: larger glthread batches

glthread hands recorded calls to its thread in batches of this size. With
8 KB a Doom 3 frame on a 2.3 GHz G5 is several hundred hand-overs; 64 KB
measured best there (8, 32, 64 and 256 KB tried; journal, 2026-10-06).

--- a/src/mesa/main/glthread.h
+++ b/src/mesa/main/glthread.h
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
  *   chance of experiencing CPU cache thrashing
  * but it should be high enough so that u_queue overhead remains negligible.
  */
-#define MARSHAL_MAX_CMD_BUFFER_SIZE (8 * 1024)
+#define MARSHAL_MAX_CMD_BUFFER_SIZE (64 * 1024)
 
 /* We need to leave 1 slot at the end to insert the END marker for unmarshal
  * calls that look ahead to know where the batch ends.
